    <p>What goes in a real Hartselle contractor website:</p>

    <ul class="trades-list-block">
      <li>A real About page that talks about who you are, where you actually work out of, and your roots in Hartselle or Morgan County (this matters here as much as it does in <a href="/locations/decatur/">Decatur</a>, maybe more)</li>
      <li>Service pages for each major service in your trade, written specifically enough that an analytical customer can read them and understand what they would actually be buying</li>
